OL,3,GNEWSATourism body given #500k to boost
OL,4,Avisitor numbers
OL,5,
OL,6,FA government has given a tourism body
OL,7,F#500,000 to attract more visitors in
OL,8,F2027.
OL,10,FMinisters have approved the top-up
OL,11,Fgrant for Visit Jersey for advertising
OL,12,Fand campaigns to attract tourists.
OL,14,FThe Government of Jersey said the
OL,15,Fhospitality sector had seen an
OL,16,F"improved season" in 2026 and it was
OL,17,F"vital that this upward trend continues
OL,18,Fto help stabilise the sector, which had
OL,19,Ffaced rising cost pressures and
OL,20,Frelatively low visitor numbers in
OL,21,Frecent years".
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
