OL,3,GNEWSATourism body given #500k to boost
OL,4,Avisitor numbers
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt said the investment supported its
OL,7,Fobjective to grow the visitor economy
OL,8,Fby increasing overnight leisure visits
OL,9,Fand total visitor spend.
